<view class="page" wx:if="{{result}}"><view class="result-label">预计每月到手</view><view class="result-amount">¥{{result.netText}}</view><view class="result-caption">{{result.city}} · 税前月薪 ¥{{result.grossText}}</view><view class="annual-card"><view><view class="annual-label">预计全年到手</view><view class="annual-value">¥{{result.annualNetText}}</view></view><view class="annual-chip">估算结果</view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">每月收入拆分</view><view class="muted small">单位：元</view></view><view class="card"><view class="breakdown-row"><view class="dot net-dot"></view><text class="break-label">税后到手</text><text class="break-value">¥{{result.netText}}</text></view><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width:{{netPercent}}%"></view></view><view class="breakdown-row"><view class="dot tax-dot"></view><text class="break-label">个人所得税</text><text class="break-value">¥{{result.taxText}}</text></view><view class="breakdown-row"><view class="dot social-dot"></view><text class="break-label">个人社保</text><text class="break-value">¥{{result.socialText}}</text></view><view class="breakdown-row"><view class="dot house-dot"></view><text class="break-label">住房公积金</text><text class="break-value">¥{{result.housingText}}</text></view></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">缴纳明细</view><view class="muted small">个人部分</view></view><view class="card"><view class="detail-row"><text>养老保险</text><text>¥{{result.pensionText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>医疗保险</text><text>¥{{result.medicalText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>失业保险</text><text>¥{{result.unemploymentText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>住房公积金（{{result.housingRate}}%）</text><text>¥{{result.housingText}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>个人所得税（估算月均）</text><text>¥{{result.taxText}}</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="detail-row total"><text>预计到手工资</text><text>¥{{result.netText}}</text></view></view></view><view class="notice">采用简化年度累计税率估算，未覆盖所有专项附加扣除及特殊收入。社保、公积金参数需按当地最新政策核实。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="backToEdit">调整参数</button><button class="secondary-btn save-btn" bindtap="saveResult">保存本次记录</button></view><view wx:else class="page"><view class="card">暂无结果，请返回首页计算。</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="goHome">返回工资计算</button></view>